---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Placeholder from '../../components/Placeholder.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What the MonoTypist website collects, why, and how to have it removed.">
  <Placeholder title="Privacy" lead="This site collects one thing: what you type into the waitlist form.">
    <p>
      The waitlist form sends your email address and the options you picked to Formspree, the form service we use. We use them for
      one purpose: to email you when ordering opens.
    </p>
    <p>The site sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads its fonts from its own server.</p>
    <p>To leave the waitlist, reply to any email we send you and we delete your entry.</p>
    <p class="t-small muted">The full privacy notice, with the company details, is published here before ordering opens.</p>
  </Placeholder>
</Base>
